#: ../../07-conventions.md:1 38286687742b4f0380b3a9b7b1c8a18e
msgid "07. Conventions"
msgstr "07. 约定"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:5 4fb7e4532c3e42b4843a7c2a9952356b
msgid ""
"Verified rules from this tree: `docs/SubmittingPatches`, root `.clang-"
"format`, module macros in `src/include/switch.h` / `switch_types.h`, and the"
" two different `modules.conf` files. There is no `.editorconfig`, no "
"`uncrustify.cfg`, and no repo-root pre-commit or clang-tidy gate."
msgstr ""
"本仓库已核实的规则来源：`docs/SubmittingPatches`、根目录 `.clang-"
"format`、`src/include/switch.h` / `switch_types.h` 中的模块宏，以及两份不同的 "
"`modules.conf`。没有 `.editorconfig`、没有 `uncrustify.cfg`，仓库根目录也没有 pre-commit 或 "
"clang-tidy 门禁。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:7 c08770c4b51347eb90ccdf8421064cba
msgid "Style and Tooling"
msgstr "风格与工具"

#: ../../07-conventions.md f14d037c99c2481a896983b5392f1027
msgid "Area"
msgstr "领域"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 6d91ede5325a44a998cbcbfd893762ab
msgid "Rule"
msgstr "规则"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 70c6ac68b2b74e1db5847c0d2a4f7c17
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "权威来源"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 8554c7af37274a2382dd8c7e87f4ae67
msgid "C/C++ formatting"
msgstr "C/C++ 格式"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 7c8dd566cfdf4ffab7eee251297386f2
msgid ""
"Tabs, 4-wide indent, 120-column limit, Linux brace style, right-aligned "
"pointers. Match surrounding code; do not reformat unrelated lines."
msgstr "使用 Tab、4 列缩进、120 列限制、Linux 大括号风格、指针右对齐。与周围代码保持一致；不要重排无关行。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md e72208da941747ba8ac328e55672c049
msgid ""
"Root `.clang-format` (`UseTab: Always`, `TabWidth`/`IndentWidth: 4`, "
"`ColumnLimit: 120`, `BreakBeforeBraces: Linux`, `PointerAlignment: Right`). "
"`docs/SubmittingPatches` (tabs, no trailing whitespace)."
msgstr ""
"根目录 `.clang-format`（`UseTab: Always`，`TabWidth`/`IndentWidth: "
"4`，`ColumnLimit: 120`，`BreakBeforeBraces: Linux`，`PointerAlignment: "
"Right`）。`docs/SubmittingPatches`（Tab，无行尾空白）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md aca67c5cb2e448ca92d06570f4f32ea2
msgid "Formatter enforcement"
msgstr "格式化强制执行"

#: ../../07-conventions.md c836e1eb9b634e4d95603428b561d209
msgid ""
"`.clang-format` exists at the repo root but is **not** run by FreeSWITCH "
"GitHub Actions. Do not assume a format-on-PR bot. Bundled `libs/srtp/` has "
"its own `.clang-format` and Travis `format.sh`; that is not the core tree."
msgstr ""
"仓库根目录有 `.clang-format`，但 FreeSWITCH GitHub Actions **不会**运行它。不要假定存在 PR "
"自动格式化机器人。捆绑的 `libs/srtp/` 有自己的 `.clang-format` 和 Travis `format.sh`；那不是核心树。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md b124c74b29d24f2aaa3d586114a96f6f
msgid "`.clang-format`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml`; `libs/srtp/format.sh`"
msgstr "`.clang-format`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml`; `libs/srtp/format.sh`"

