#: ../../07-conventions.md 2b4191ddfe5a4a0284d5a9b566e06b87
msgid ""
"Clang `scan-build-14` on PRs via `ci.sh -t scan-build` (uses "
"`build/modules.conf.most` plus explicit enable/disable edits). Address-"
"sanitizer unit-test configure is a separate `ci.sh -t unit-test` path."
msgstr ""
"PR 上通过 `ci.sh -t scan-build` 运行 Clang `scan-build-14`（使用 "
"`build/modules.conf.most` 并做显式启用/禁用编辑）。Address Sanitizer 单元测试配置是另一条 `ci.sh "
"-t unit-test` 路径。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md fc120522e8f5487f99e385ab713c24aa
msgid "`ci.sh`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml`"
msgstr "`ci.sh`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 49b1651a025246e3a2ee997acf98bb47
msgid "Shell (`ci.sh` only)"
msgstr "Shell（仅 `ci.sh`）"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 36580578eeff4f91a55ac9f95d92c6fa
msgid ""
"Comment documents `shfmt -w -s -ci -sr -kp -fn ci.sh`. That is a helper-"
"script convention, not a tree-wide shell linter."
msgstr ""
"注释写明 `shfmt -w -s -ci -sr -kp -fn ci.sh`。这是辅助脚本约定，不是全仓库的 shell linter。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 0cc019262afa4561a57b0f291bbba8d2
