"New core/module C files carry the MPL 1.1 FreeSWITCH header used throughout "
"`src/` and `src/include/`."
msgstr "新的核心/模块 C 文件应带上 `src/` 与 `src/include/` 中通用的 MPL 1.1 FreeSWITCH 文件头。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md e7f4f8dddb4a46268eac523c806c0312
