#: ../../07-conventions.md f74a0bfe8e214d3f885344301b4921c1
msgid ""
"Run `./scripts/setup-git.sh` from the repo root (real name and email, not a "
"username). It sets `pull.rebase` and `branch.master.rebase` to `true`."
msgstr ""
"从仓库根目录运行 `./scripts/setup-git.sh`（使用真实姓名和邮箱，不要用用户名）。它会把 `pull.rebase` 和 "
"`branch.master.rebase` 设为 `true`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md f5ebdb370a5a4140adf70d8659eff7d6
