#: ../../07-conventions.md 90a496dacc11452a88b8d4360c95b856
msgid "Commits"
msgstr "提交"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 7d02e6cf982f41a99841e7f0a0e969fa
msgid ""
"Topic branch; one identifiable change per commit; present-tense imperative "
"subject typically &lt; 50 characters; body hard-wrapped 68–72 characters; "
"empty line after subject. Mention JIRA as `FS-XXXX` on its own line; add "
"`#resolve` if the commit closes it. Rebase onto upstream; do not merge "
"master into the topic branch."
msgstr ""
"主题分支；每次提交一个可识别的改动；现在时祈使语气的标题通常 &lt; 50 个字符；正文硬折行 68–72 个字符；标题后空一行。JIRA 以 "
"`FS-XXXX` 单独成行；若该提交关闭工单则加 `#resolve`。变基到上游；不要把 master 合并进主题分支。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md ../../07-conventions.md:106
#: ae50536e482d4593b4b310bb3f6166d9 b9bf4b1474dc45979dec6f77223ea48d
msgid "`docs/SubmittingPatches`"
msgstr "`docs/SubmittingPatches`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 32e8657550af481f997b18143dc6b1bc
msgid "Review path"
msgstr "评审路径"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 8fb3385398a34c28b7a03edcc09ce4b1
msgid ""
"GitHub pull requests are the inclusion path (`README.md`). CI on PR "
"open/sync: unit tests + scan-build (`ci.yml`). Mailing-list patches are not "
"the inclusion path (`docs/SubmittingPatches`)."
msgstr ""
"纳入路径是 GitHub pull request（`README.md`）。PR 打开/同步时的 CI：单元测试 + scan-"
"build（`ci.yml`）。邮件列表补丁不是纳入路径（`docs/SubmittingPatches`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 92b6d10d873841eabd17ec044e539555
msgid "`README.md`; `docs/SubmittingPatches`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml`"
msgstr "`README.md`; `docs/SubmittingPatches`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:23 eff2bd7b80f7497eb808e6027ed2a2d2
msgid ""
"Practical C style for this tree: **match surrounding code**, use **tabs**, "
"keep the **Emacs/VIM footer**, and treat root `.clang-format` as the written"
" style when you do format — not as a CI gate. There is no uncrustify config."
msgstr ""
"本仓库实用的 C 风格：**与周围代码保持一致**、使用 **Tab**、保留 **Emacs/VIM 页脚**，需要格式化时以根目录 `.clang-"
"format` 为书面规范——而不是 CI 门禁。没有 uncrustify 配置。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:25 36605a69fdbd426e8c367ed3056fff64
msgid "Naming and Layout"
msgstr "命名与布局"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:27 44d4a5eb043d4f31a9af45561610c094
msgid ""
"**Core files**: `src/switch_<area>.c` with matching "
"`src/include/switch_<area>.h`. Process entry is `src/switch.c`. Public "
"umbrella header is `src/include/switch.h` — module authors include that, not"
" a private core `.c`."
msgstr ""
"**核心文件**：`src/switch_<area>.c`，对应头文件 `src/include/switch_<area>.h`。进程入口是 "
"`src/switch.c`。对外总头文件是 `src/include/switch.h`——模块作者应包含它，而不是私有核心 `.c`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:28 f994feda540c4f97a293c6528db12622
msgid ""
"**Modules**: `src/mod/<category>/mod_<name>/` with primary source "
"`mod_<name>.c` (or `.cpp`). Categories in this tree: `applications`, "
"`endpoints`, `codecs`, `say`, `event_handlers`, `formats`, `languages`, "
"`xml_int`, `loggers`, `dialplans`, `asr_tts`, `databases`, `timers`, "
"`directories`, `sdk`."
msgstr ""
"**模块**：`src/mod/<category>/mod_<name>/`，主源文件为 `mod_<name>.c`（或 "
"`.cpp`）。本仓库中的类别：`applications`、`endpoints`、`codecs`、`say`、`event_handlers`、`formats`、`languages`、`xml_int`、`loggers`、`dialplans`、`asr_tts`、`databases`、`timers`、`directories`、`sdk`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:29 3d310169da6140a8a46f09d4403161be
msgid ""
"**Module API**: declare load/shutdown/runtime with "
"`SWITCH_MODULE_LOAD_FUNCTION`, `SWITCH_MODULE_SHUTDOWN_FUNCTION`, "
"`SWITCH_MODULE_RUNTIME_FUNCTION`, then `SWITCH_MODULE_DEFINITION(mod_name, "
"load, shutdown, runtime)` (`src/include/switch_types.h`). Skeleton: "
"`src/mod/applications/mod_skel/` and `build/standalone_module/mod_skel.c`."
msgstr ""
"**模块 API**：用 "
"`SWITCH_MODULE_LOAD_FUNCTION`、`SWITCH_MODULE_SHUTDOWN_FUNCTION`、`SWITCH_MODULE_RUNTIME_FUNCTION`"
" 声明 load/shutdown/runtime，然后 `SWITCH_MODULE_DEFINITION(mod_name, load, "
"shutdown, "
"runtime)`（`src/include/switch_types.h`）。骨架：`src/mod/applications/mod_skel/` "
"与 `build/standalone_module/mod_skel.c`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:30 bfbe41ea83cb418fb8c4a0bd487f0a59
msgid ""
"**Exported vs private**: symbols not meant to be exported are `static` "
"(`docs/SubmittingPatches`). Public core APIs use `SWITCH_DECLARE(...)` "
"(`src/include/switch_platform.h`). Register console APIs with "
"`SWITCH_ADD_API` and dialplan apps with `SWITCH_ADD_APP` "
"(`src/include/switch_loadable_module.h`)."
msgstr ""
"**导出与私有**：不打算导出的符号用 `static`（`docs/SubmittingPatches`）。公开核心 API 使用 "
"`SWITCH_DECLARE(...)`（`src/include/switch_platform.h`）。用 `SWITCH_ADD_API` "
"注册控制台 API，用 `SWITCH_ADD_APP` "
"注册拨号计划应用（`src/include/switch_loadable_module.h`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:31 e40cfef7a43745d7a3b83f3ce1db9dfe
msgid ""
"**Config files**: `<feature>.conf.xml` under "
"`conf/<profile>/autoload_configs/` (or the module’s own `conf/` samples). "
"Runtime module load list is XML `<load module=\"mod_…\"/>`, not a "
"`src/mod/…` path."
msgstr ""
"**配置文件**：`<feature>.conf.xml`，位于 `conf/<profile>/autoload_configs/`（或模块自带的 "
"`conf/` 样例）。运行时模块加载列表是 XML `<load module=\"mod_…\"/>`，不是 `src/mod/…` 路径。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:32 2ac539ef455e40bd98eaa4f3278f7b83
msgid ""
"**XML preprocessor**: `#include` / `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS`. You cannot "
"comment out an `X-PRE-PROCESS` line — remove it (`conf/vanilla/vars.xml`). "
"Flattened dump is `freeswitch.xml.fsxml`; do not edit it while the process "
"is running."
msgstr ""
"**XML 预处理器**：`#include` / `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS`。不能把 `X-PRE-PROCESS` "
"行注释掉——必须删掉（`conf/vanilla/vars.xml`）。展开后的转储是 "
"`freeswitch.xml.fsxml`；进程运行时不要编辑它。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:33 500b02f6f7244e54a9781738a442eb89
msgid ""
"**PKB**: English source lives in `man/` (not `docs/man/`, which is Unix man "
"pages). `man/pyproject.toml` is Sphinx/Poetry for this knowledge base — "
"**not** product runtime dependencies."
msgstr ""
"**PKB**：英文源在 `man/`（不是 `docs/man/`，后者是 Unix man page）。`man/pyproject.toml` "
"是本知识库的 Sphinx/Poetry 依赖——**不是**产品运行时依赖。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:35 e6a65c59b7e14a8687399f9d8b5a97d1
msgid "Two `modules.conf` files (do not mix)"
msgstr "两份 `modules.conf`（不要混用）"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 4816946cf9f54325899af07667337dd4
msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 772cf54aa1ef42108aee04f7ce0d7fc2
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 6e7518323593407485eb1567d95a91d1
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../07-conventions.md e9affe5f582d4ebf8015fcceff409561
msgid ""
"`build/modules.conf.in` → copied to repo-root `modules.conf` by "
"`bootstrap.sh` if missing"
msgstr ""
"`build/modules.conf.in` → 若不存在则由 `bootstrap.sh` 复制为仓库根目录的 `modules.conf`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 26125cbcfb934dbd97c8eb719ceaa62e
msgid "**Build**: which `src/mod/<category>/mod_*` trees are compiled"
msgstr "**构建**：编译哪些 `src/mod/<category>/mod_*` 目录树"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 341b2d27d02e425ab5014be9fdada790
msgid "Lines like `endpoints/mod_sofia`; `#` comments disable"
msgstr "形如 `endpoints/mod_sofia` 的行；`#` 注释表示禁用"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 5f4eff0d503e41c1a8be28df6ca201ca
msgid ""
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/modules.conf.xml` (installed under "
"`$prefix/conf/`)"
msgstr "`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/modules.conf.xml`（安装到 `$prefix/conf/`）"

#: ../../07-conventions.md b664735b2c1c4a3cae390a5738239c56
msgid "**Runtime**: which already-built modules the process loads"
msgstr "**运行时**：进程加载哪些已经编译好的模块"

#: ../../07-conventions.md c3c91a20d4d2400dad6929e76af191ea
msgid "`<load module=\"mod_sofia\"/>`"
msgstr "`<load module=\"mod_sofia\"/>`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:42 607725ccecd043d58e3fb6bce0d5ea67
msgid ""
"A module can be compiled and still not load, or listed in XML and missing "
"from `mod/` because it was commented out at build time. "
"`build/modules.conf.most` is the scan-build “almost everything” list, not "
"the default."
msgstr ""
"模块可以编译了却不加载，也可以写在 XML 里却因构建时被注释而不在 `mod/` 中。`build/modules.conf.most` 是 "
"scan-build 的「几乎全部」列表，不是默认值。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:44 1e7c7c9e32d245b0a6b9d3f165806a33
msgid "Error Handling"
msgstr "错误处理"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:46 cff07ea1a28345eaa151c2ddfb929b02
msgid ""
"**Classification**: C APIs return `switch_status_t` "
"(`src/include/switch_types.h`). Common values: `SWITCH_STATUS_SUCCESS`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_FALSE`, `SWITCH_STATUS_TIMEOUT`, `SWITCH_STATUS_RESTART`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_INTR`, `SWITCH_STATUS_NOTIMPL`, `SWITCH_STATUS_MEMERR`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_NOOP`, `SWITCH_STATUS_GENERR`, `SWITCH_STATUS_INUSE`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_BREAK`, `SWITCH_STATUS_SOCKERR`, `SWITCH_STATUS_MORE_DATA`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_NOTFOUND`, `SWITCH_STATUS_UNLOAD`, `SWITCH_STATUS_NOUNLOAD`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_IGNORE`, `SWITCH_STATUS_TOO_SMALL`, `SWITCH_STATUS_FOUND`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_CONTINUE`, `SWITCH_STATUS_TERM`, "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_NOT_INITALIZED`, `SWITCH_STATUS_TOO_LATE`. Compare against "
"these constants; do not invent ad-hoc integer codes for core/module APIs."
msgstr ""
"**分类**：C API 返回 "
"`switch_status_t`（`src/include/switch_types.h`）。常见取值：`SWITCH_STATUS_SUCCESS`、`SWITCH_STATUS_FALSE`、`SWITCH_STATUS_TIMEOUT`、`SWITCH_STATUS_RESTART`、`SWITCH_STATUS_INTR`、`SWITCH_STATUS_NOTIMPL`、`SWITCH_STATUS_MEMERR`、`SWITCH_STATUS_NOOP`、`SWITCH_STATUS_GENERR`、`SWITCH_STATUS_INUSE`、`SWITCH_STATUS_BREAK`、`SWITCH_STATUS_SOCKERR`、`SWITCH_STATUS_MORE_DATA`、`SWITCH_STATUS_NOTFOUND`、`SWITCH_STATUS_UNLOAD`、`SWITCH_STATUS_NOUNLOAD`、`SWITCH_STATUS_IGNORE`、`SWITCH_STATUS_TOO_SMALL`、`SWITCH_STATUS_FOUND`、`SWITCH_STATUS_CONTINUE`、`SWITCH_STATUS_TERM`、`SWITCH_STATUS_NOT_INITALIZED`、`SWITCH_STATUS_TOO_LATE`。与这些常量比较；不要为核心/模块"
" API 发明临时整数码。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:47 fe8dce66047b4364b2e546880059934b
msgid ""
"**Load/runtime**: module load functions return `switch_status_t`. Runtime "
"threads that should not be rescheduled return `SWITCH_STATUS_TERM` (see "
"`mod_skel` comments). `SWITCH_STATUS_NOUNLOAD` means “never unload”."
msgstr ""
"**加载/运行时**：模块 load 函数返回 `switch_status_t`。不应再被调度的运行时线程返回 "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_TERM`（见 `mod_skel` 注释）。`SWITCH_STATUS_NOUNLOAD` 表示「永不卸载」。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:48 b79e96377e044a2b892b819acf4290c6
msgid ""
"**Media reads**: `SWITCH_READ_ACCEPTABLE(status)` treats `SUCCESS`, `BREAK`,"
" and `INUSE` as acceptable (`src/include/switch_utils.h`)."
msgstr ""
"**媒体读取**：`SWITCH_READ_ACCEPTABLE(status)` 把 `SUCCESS`、`BREAK` 和 `INUSE` "
"视为可接受（`src/include/switch_utils.h`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:49 48ff1d2ab83042a08d58cc28df45b121
msgid ""
"**User-facing errors**: ESL replies are `+OK` / `-ERR` after `auth` "
"(`mod_event_socket.c` `parse_command()`). Console/API strings go through "
"`SWITCH_ADD_API`. Call teardown uses channel hangup causes, not a REST error"
" body. SIP status is Sofia’s problem, not a second core errno."
msgstr ""
"**面向用户的错误**：`auth` 之后 ESL 回复是 `+OK` / `-ERR`（`mod_event_socket.c` 的 "
"`parse_command()`）。控制台/API 字符串走 `SWITCH_ADD_API`。呼叫拆除使用信道挂断原因，不是 REST "
"错误体。SIP 状态是 Sofia 的事，不是第二套核心 errno。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:50 2257d4d2c43f4c6d8d8a0cdd16f6eece
msgid ""
"**Null/empty strings**: use `zstr()` (`switch_utils.h`). `switch_assert()` "
"aborts on invariant failure (`switch_platform.h`) — not a substitute for "
"returning `SWITCH_STATUS_*` on expected failures."
msgstr ""
"**空/空字符串**：使用 `zstr()`（`switch_utils.h`）。`switch_assert()` "
"在不变量失败时中止（`switch_platform.h`）——不能代替在预期失败时返回 `SWITCH_STATUS_*`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:51 c860824d0ab542688222f8ccb4750a0c
msgid ""
"**Retries or fallbacks**: there is no project-wide retry wrapper. "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_RESTART` / `BREAK` / `TIMEOUT` are control-flow statuses for "
"the caller. SIP retransmission lives in Sofia; do not add a generic “retry "
"three times” layer in new module code unless that module already does so."
msgstr ""
"**重试或回退**：没有项目级的重试封装。`SWITCH_STATUS_RESTART` / `BREAK` / `TIMEOUT` "
"是给调用方的控制流状态。SIP 重传在 Sofia 里；除非该模块已经这样做，否则不要在新模块代码里加一层通用的「重试三次」。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:53 04b9f545bb8d42cdade1109308af6843
msgid "Logging and Diagnostics"
msgstr "日志与诊断"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:55 a1063c9a0ba64798802729ad2e412d26
msgid ""
"**API**: `switch_log_printf(SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG, SWITCH_LOG_<LEVEL>, "
"\"fmt\\n\", …)` (`src/include/switch_log.h`). The first argument is a "
"**channel macro** that supplies file, function, and line "
"(`SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG`, `SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG_CLEAN`, "
"`SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG(session)`, `SWITCH_CHANNEL_UUID_LOG(uuid)` in "
"`switch_types.h`). Optional JSON metadata: `switch_log_meta_printf`."
msgstr ""
"**API**：`switch_log_printf(SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG, SWITCH_LOG_<LEVEL>, "
"\"fmt\\n\", "
"…)`（`src/include/switch_log.h`）。第一个参数是**信道宏**，提供文件、函数和行号（`switch_types.h` 中的"
" "
"`SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG`、`SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG_CLEAN`、`SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG(session)`、`SWITCH_CHANNEL_UUID_LOG(uuid)`）。可选"
" JSON 元数据：`switch_log_meta_printf`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:56 3fde5ab76e3c4fba932e461d4f8e0f46
msgid ""
"**Levels** (`switch_log_level_t`): `DEBUG10`…`DEBUG1`, then `DEBUG` (7), "
"`INFO` (6), `NOTICE` (5), `WARNING` (4), `ERROR` (3), `CRIT` (2), `ALERT` "
"(1), `CONSOLE` (0), plus `DISABLE` / `INVALID` / `UNINIT`. Prefer "
"`ERROR`/`CRIT` for failures, `WARNING` for recoverable misconfig, "
"`DEBUG`/`DEBUG1`+ for packet/session chatter."
msgstr ""
"**级别**（`switch_log_level_t`）：`DEBUG10`…`DEBUG1`，然后是 "
"`DEBUG`（7）、`INFO`（6）、`NOTICE`（5）、`WARNING`（4）、`ERROR`（3）、`CRIT`（2）、`ALERT`（1）、`CONSOLE`（0），再加上"
" `DISABLE` / `INVALID` / `UNINIT`。失败用 `ERROR`/`CRIT`，可恢复的错误配置用 "
"`WARNING`，包/会话噪声用 `DEBUG`/`DEBUG1`+。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:57 7b49cdecb5904132b5a32496377c7f32
msgid ""
"**Required fields**: file, function, and line are automatic via the channel "
"macros. Session-scoped logs should use `SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG(session)`"
" so the UUID is attached. `conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/logfile.conf.xml` "
"can prefix lines with the session UUID (`<param name=\"uuid\" "
"value=\"true\"/>`). Log nodes also carry timestamp and a sequence "
"(`switch_log_node_t`)."
msgstr ""
"**必填字段**：文件、函数和行号由信道宏自动提供。会话范围的日志应使用 `SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG(session)` "
"以便附上 UUID。`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/logfile.conf.xml` 可以在行前加上会话 "
"UUID（`<param name=\"uuid\" "
"value=\"true\"/>`）。日志节点还带时间戳和序号（`switch_log_node_t`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:58 58c7aece54f249b3ba94c83fbd52cc46
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Where it goes**: console mappings in `console.conf.xml` "
"(`$${console_loglevel}`); file logger `mod_logfile` (rotate-on-HUP, "
"rollover). Operators map by file name, function name, or `all`."
msgstr ""
"**去向**：控制台映射在 `console.conf.xml`（`$${console_loglevel}`）；文件记录器是 "
"`mod_logfile`（HUP 时轮转、按大小滚动）。运维可按文件名、函数名或 `all` 做映射。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:59 eefef699d3a54e688addfd38380b9986
msgid ""
"**Debug workflow**: raise console/file maps for the file under study "
"(`mod_sofia.c`, `switch_core_state_machine.c`, …); `fs_cli` `/log debug`; "
"`freeswitch -c -nonat` for a foreground console. Unit tests often start the "
"core with `SCF_LOG_DISABLE` (`src/include/test/switch_test.h`)."
msgstr ""
"**调试流程**：提高正在研究的文件的控制台/文件映射（`mod_sofia.c`、`switch_core_state_machine.c` "
"等）；`fs_cli` `/log debug`；前台控制台用 `freeswitch -c -nonat`。单元测试常常以 "
"`SCF_LOG_DISABLE` 启动核心（`src/include/test/switch_test.h`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:60 2c41f427f31f4d9bac447a777dbef207
msgid ""
"**Sensitive data policy**: never log ESL passwords, SIP digest credentials, "
"voicemail PINs, SignalWire PATs, or XML-RPC `auth-pass` at info-or-higher in"
" examples or new code as if they were production-safe. Demo values "
"(`ClueCon`, `default_password=1234`, users 1000–1019) are **known-insecure "
"samples**, not a logging exemption. Do not paste production auth into PKB "
"examples."
msgstr ""
"**敏感数据策略**：不要在示例或新代码里把 ESL 密码、SIP digest 凭据、语音信箱 PIN、SignalWire PAT 或 XML-"
"RPC `auth-pass` 以 info "
"及以上级别记日志，仿佛它们生产可用。演示值（`ClueCon`、`default_password=1234`、用户 "
"1000–1019）是**已知不安全的样例**，不是日志豁免。不要把生产认证贴进 PKB 示例。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:62 8394f6a338aa40a5a641a5ea56cd98da
msgid "Configuration and Secrets"
msgstr "配置与密钥"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:64 dc8607e4652b45dbb4ecd0328b994a6a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Config sources**: XML under `conf/<profile>/` (vanilla is the demo PBX). "
"Preprocessor variables in `vars.xml` (`$${default_password}`, "
"`$${console_loglevel}`, …). Module settings in `autoload_configs/*.xml`. "
"Build-time module set: `modules.conf`. Install prefix and version: "
"`configure.ac`."
msgstr ""
"**配置来源**：`conf/<profile>/` 下的 XML（vanilla 是演示 PBX）。预处理器变量在 "
"`vars.xml`（`$${default_password}`、`$${console_loglevel}` 等）。模块设置在 "
"`autoload_configs/*.xml`。构建时模块集合：`modules.conf`。安装前缀和版本：`configure.ac`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:65 7b8c4288020f44b9a50c78915da4b105
msgid ""
"**Override order**: preprocessor `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS` expands before XML"
" parse. Runtime `reloadxml` re-reads XML; it does not rebuild modules. "
"Enabling a module requires **both** an uncommented build line **and** a "
"runtime `<load>` (unless you `load mod_*` from the console)."
msgstr ""
"**覆盖顺序**：预处理器 `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS` 在 XML 解析之前展开。运行时 `reloadxml` 会重新读取 "
"XML；它不会重新编译模块。启用一个模块需要**同时**有未注释的构建行**以及**运行时 `<load>`（除非你从控制台 `load "
"mod_*`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:66 549dce2ec2d94e718e6eeb3d3378fb1b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Vanilla is demo, not production**: `conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`. "
"Default directory users 1000–1019 share `$${default_password}` (`1234` in "
"`vars.xml`); voicemail PINs match the extension. Dialplan logs CRIT and "
"sleeps 10s while the password is still `1234` "
"(`conf/vanilla/dialplan/default.xml`). Change passwords or run "
"`scripts/perl/randomize-passwords.pl`. Start with `-nonat` unless UPnP/NAT-"
"PMP pinholes are intentional."
msgstr ""
"**Vanilla 是演示，不是生产**：`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`。默认 directory 用户 "
"1000–1019 共用 `$${default_password}`（`vars.xml` 中为 `1234`）；语音信箱 PIN "
"与分机号相同。密码仍为 `1234` 时，拨号计划会打 CRIT 日志并睡眠 10 "
"秒（`conf/vanilla/dialplan/default.xml`）。请改密码或运行 `scripts/perl/randomize-"
"passwords.pl`。除非有意做 UPnP/NAT-PMP 打孔，否则用 `-nonat` 启动。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:67 88618d8c3abf4a31a3d784bf09027122
msgid ""
"**ESL**: default password `ClueCon` "
"(`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/event_socket.conf.xml` listens on `::` port "
"8021; the module sample in `src/mod/event_handlers/mod_event_socket/conf/` "
"binds `127.0.0.1`). `libs/esl/fs_cli.conf` uses the same password. **Change "
"it** before any non-loopback exposure. Erlang cookie samples also use "
"`ClueCon`."
msgstr ""
"**ESL**：默认密码 `ClueCon`（`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/event_socket.conf.xml`"
" 监听 `::` 端口 8021；模块样例 `src/mod/event_handlers/mod_event_socket/conf/` 绑定 "
"`127.0.0.1`）。`libs/esl/fs_cli.conf` 使用同一密码。在任何非回环暴露之前**务必改掉**。Erlang cookie "
"样例也用 `ClueCon`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:68 1db1120e013e4ba79ffd7c74a07f2405
msgid ""
"**XML-RPC demo auth** (not in vanilla autoload): `auth-user` `freeswitch` / "
"`auth-pass` `works` "
"(`src/mod/xml_int/mod_xml_rpc/conf/autoload_configs/xml_rpc.conf.xml`)."
msgstr ""
"**XML-RPC 演示认证**（不在 vanilla autoload 中）：`auth-user` `freeswitch` / `auth-"
"pass` "
"`works`（`src/mod/xml_int/mod_xml_rpc/conf/autoload_configs/xml_rpc.conf.xml`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:69 30d3d86849fc4c468d90f0526ad903cf
msgid ""
"**Packaging secrets**: FSGET and packaged Docker images need a SignalWire "
"Personal Access Token (`scripts/packaging/README.md`). Pass the PAT on the "
"command line or as a Docker `TOKEN` build-arg — **never commit it**. Source "
"builds do not need that token (`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile`)."
msgstr ""
"**打包密钥**：FSGET 和打包的 Docker 镜像需要 SignalWire Personal Access "
"Token（`scripts/packaging/README.md`）。在命令行或 Docker `TOKEN` build-arg 传入 "
"PAT——**永远不要提交**。源码构建不需要该 token（`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:70 23efd4406cc047518ca08eb937bb17c8
msgid ""
"**No secrets in git**: do not add PATs, production SIP passwords, TLS "
"private keys, or live ESL passwords to this repository. Demo XML that "
"already contains `ClueCon` / `1234` stays demo; new config must not copy "
"those values as if they were a baseline."
msgstr ""
"**密钥不要进 git**：不要把 PAT、生产 SIP 密码、TLS 私钥或线上 ESL 密码加入本仓库。已经含有 `ClueCon` / "
"`1234` 的演示 XML 继续当演示；新配置不得把这些值当成基线去复制。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:71 d6d804b64d5a4e10b21cd29fa3416437
msgid ""
"**Version bump**: keep together (comment in `configure.ac`): "
"`AC_INIT([freeswitch], […])`, `SWITCH_VERSION_MAJOR` / `MINOR` / `MICRO` "
"(and optional `REVISION` / `REVISION_HUMAN` for a tagged release), and "
"`build/next-release.txt`. See [Build](08-build.md)."
msgstr ""
"**版本号变更**：必须一起改（`configure.ac` 中的注释）：`AC_INIT([freeswitch], "
"[…])`、`SWITCH_VERSION_MAJOR` / `MINOR` / `MICRO`（打标签发布时还可选 `REVISION` / "
"`REVISION_HUMAN`），以及 `build/next-release.txt`。参见 [构建](08-build.md)。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:73 5798790fc01d4435bf3bf4309e55eebb
msgid "Testing and Review Expectations"
msgstr "测试与评审期望"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:75 9a331aec3da94afebb157909e4e30837
msgid ""
"**Core unit tests**: Autotools programs under `tests/unit/` against "
"`libfreeswitch`. New tests **must** use `src/include/test/switch_test.h` "
"(`tests/unit/README`). Run `tests/unit/run-tests.sh` after "
"configure/build/install; CI chunks with `./run-tests.sh 2 1` (`ci.yml` "
"`TOTAL_GROUPS: 2`). ESL: `make -C libs/esl check` (CI group 1)."
msgstr ""
"**核心单元测试**：`tests/unit/` 下针对 `libfreeswitch` 的 Autotools 程序。新测试**必须**使用 "
"`src/include/test/switch_test.h`（`tests/unit/README`）。configure/build/install"
" 之后运行 `tests/unit/run-tests.sh`；CI 分片为 `./run-tests.sh 2 1`（`ci.yml` 的 "
"`TOTAL_GROUPS: 2`）。ESL：`make -C libs/esl check`（CI 第 1 组）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:76 189dc42a6303446191e3692f0abd8a2e
msgid ""
"**Module tests**: some modules ship `test/` trees (for example Sofia SIPp "
"under `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/`). Enable the module in **build** "
"`modules.conf` before those tests can link."
msgstr ""
"**模块测试**：部分模块自带 `test/` 树（例如 `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/` 下的 Sofia "
"SIPp）。这些测试要能链接，须先在**构建**用的 `modules.conf` 中启用该模块。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:77 1dde0ef98dac4be88aea30e5fc3e68ed
msgid ""
"**CI on a GitHub PR**: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (unit-test groups via "
"`ci.sh`, optional DinD, `scan-build`). Platform packs: `build.yml`, "
"`macos.yml`, `windows.yml`. Treat a red `ci.yml` as blocking."
msgstr ""
"**GitHub PR 上的 CI**：`.github/workflows/ci.yml`（经 `ci.sh` 的单元测试分组、可选 "
"DinD、`scan-build`）。平台包：`build.yml`、`macos.yml`、`windows.yml`。把变红的 `ci.yml` "
"视为阻断。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:78 84742b1a25254b5ebd6a9a4831b5c665
msgid ""
"**New module checklist** (`docs/SubmittingPatches`): `Makefile.am`; entry in"
" `configure.ac`; commented line in `build/modules.conf.in`; header comments "
"describing the module; whitespace footer; `static` for private symbols; **do"
" not** add files to `conf/vanilla`; commit body explains why it exists and "
"what is unfinished."
msgstr ""
"**新模块清单**（`docs/SubmittingPatches`）：`Makefile.am`；`configure.ac` "
"中的条目；`build/modules.conf.in` 中的注释行；描述模块的头注释；空白页脚；私有符号用 `static`；**不要**向 "
"`conf/vanilla` 添加文件；提交正文说明它为何存在、哪些尚未完成。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:79 595fee49fa6e4b00a7b96131ac12efdf
msgid ""
"**Docs for changes**: behavior, flags, or XML knobs belong in the commit "
"body. PKB pages under `man/` are English source for this knowledge base — "
"update the affected numbered page when layout, build, or conventions change;"
" do not treat `man/pyproject.toml` as a FreeSWITCH dependency bump."
msgstr ""
"**变更文档**：行为、标志或 XML 旋钮写在提交正文。`man/` 下的 PKB "
"页是本知识库的英文源——布局、构建或约定变化时更新对应编号页；不要把 `man/pyproject.toml` 当成 FreeSWITCH 依赖升级。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:80 44d334627fd34524ad5c87b98eb5f33c
msgid ""
"**Review focus**: media/SIP compatibility, module load vs build-list "
"mistakes, secret leakage in samples, rebase-clean history, scan-build noise,"
" and whether vanilla XML was treated as production."
msgstr ""
"**评审重点**：媒体/SIP 兼容性、模块加载与构建列表搞混、样例中的密钥泄漏、干净的变基历史、scan-build 噪声，以及是否把 vanilla"
" XML 当成了生产配置。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:82 21ca1fd690c242cd8a59719b49e05286
msgid "Anti-Patterns"
msgstr "反模式"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:84 f918d20d9162418fb41ca45a3e9270cb
msgid ""
"Mixing **build** `modules.conf` / `build/modules.conf.in` with **runtime** "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/modules.conf.xml` (different files, different"
" syntax, different effect)."
msgstr ""
"把**构建**用的 `modules.conf` / `build/modules.conf.in` 与**运行时**的 "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/modules.conf.xml` 混为一谈（不同文件、不同语法、不同效果）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:85 edcd904597264229b21f3812dfd85945
msgid ""
"Treating `conf/vanilla` as a production baseline (`README_IMPORTANT.txt`). "
"Shipping `default_password=1234`, users 1000–1019, ESL `ClueCon`, or XML-RPC"
" `works` as if they were safe."
msgstr ""
"把 `conf/vanilla` 当成生产基线（`README_IMPORTANT.txt`）。把 `default_password=1234`、用户"
" 1000–1019、ESL `ClueCon` 或 XML-RPC `works` 当作安全配置去发布。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:86 e41ace3a836c464eb9011dcaf4e542a8
msgid ""
"Logging or documenting ESL `ClueCon` or SIP digest/voicemail secrets as "
"production-ready examples."
msgstr "把 ESL `ClueCon` 或 SIP digest/语音信箱密钥作为生产可用示例来记日志或写进文档。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:87 a22ab2c23a3b483385523bd949509755
msgid ""
"Committing a SignalWire PAT, Docker `TOKEN`, or any live credential. Putting"
" secrets in git “just for CI”."
msgstr "提交 SignalWire PAT、Docker `TOKEN` 或任何线上凭据。把密钥放进 git「只是为了 CI」。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:88 abccda7cb9e74c9f9604031ed14ec46d
msgid ""
"Bumping only `AC_INIT` or only `build/next-release.txt` instead of all "
"version fields together."
msgstr "只改 `AC_INIT` 或只改 `build/next-release.txt`，而不是所有版本字段一起改。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:89 382adadf36064b68b5e71ec359f11aee
msgid ""
"Whitespace-only or drive-by reformat mixed into a functional commit; merge "
"commits of master into a topic branch (`docs/SubmittingPatches`)."
msgstr "把纯空白或顺手重排混进功能提交；把 master 合并进主题分支（`docs/SubmittingPatches`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:90 9e0cdc4a4bf347a3b58890237ed5756b
msgid ""
"Exporting internal module symbols; skipping `static`; omitting the Emacs/VIM"
" footer on new `*.[ch]`."
msgstr "导出模块内部符号；漏写 `static`；新 `*.[ch]` 省略 Emacs/VIM 页脚。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:91 c276afd49aca4512ae13f186b45a2e1d
msgid "Adding sample XML to `conf/vanilla` as part of a new module PR."
msgstr "在新模块 PR 中向 `conf/vanilla` 添加样例 XML。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:92 bc7f7d24c8ce4d51acfe2c63a04220e3
msgid ""
"Commenting out `X-PRE-PROCESS` lines, or editing `freeswitch.xml.fsxml` "
"while FreeSWITCH is running."
msgstr "把 `X-PRE-PROCESS` 行注释掉，或在 FreeSWITCH 运行时编辑 `freeswitch.xml.fsxml`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:93 2938adb67c924093a530db37b3b79b49
msgid ""
"Starting a public-facing box without `-nonat` and without ACLs on SIP/ESL "
"ports."
msgstr "在面向公网的机器上启动时不加 `-nonat`，也不给 SIP/ESL 端口加 ACL。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:94 a61ea294979c4b5da0f70ebcb91ef73d
msgid ""
"Treating `docs/man/` as this PKB, or `man/pyproject.toml` as product Python "
"dependencies."
msgstr "把 `docs/man/` 当成这份 PKB，或把 `man/pyproject.toml` 当成产品 Python 依赖。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:95 54cf35b00ada4d5186833541242cc312
msgid ""
"Sending patches only to the mailing list and expecting them to land "
"(`docs/SubmittingPatches`); skipping GitHub PR CI (`README.md`, `ci.yml`)."
msgstr ""
